.loom/
# Generated at binary build time from the LOOM_CLIENT_TOKEN Actions secret (see
# packaging/loom.spec); never committed. It holds the write-only ingest token
# binaries send to telemetry-proxy/ — not a Langfuse key, which would be
# readable. See TELEMETRY.md.
